      "content": "A Debt with a missing anchor throws here instead of returning a validation issue; an anchor object without tradeId instead inserts undefined into the Trade-reference set. Unlike the existing Entry/decline scan, this bypasses MissingAnchor handling. Read the anchor defensively and report MissingAnchor with debt.debtId before collecting the reference.",
