      "path": "src/modules/journal/section.ts",
      "content": "Reciprocal IDs and matching definitions do not establish that the outcome answers the same obligation. A Debt for pc-1 and an Entry for pc-2 can point to each other and pass validation; the Debt is then excluded from current outcomes even though no outcome holds its obligation key. Retain the outcome's obligationKey in SettlementLink and reject mismatches for both Entries and declines.",
