      "path": "src/modules/journal/section.ts",
      "content": "The reverse-link key loses the outcome's store. If an Entry and a decline share an ID but have different obligation keys, and both name the same Debt, a Settled version naming only the Entry adds a key that also satisfies the decline's reverse check. This inconsistent decline is accepted without an issue. Include the store in both tracking keys (or keep separate sets), since these records are keyed independently in their respective stores.",
